:: ChildhoodContinued [childhood]
# Growing Up in the Tribe

<div class="season-indicator season-<<print $environment.season>>">
  <<print $environment.season.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.season.slice(1)>> • 
  <<print $environment.weather.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.weather.slice(1)>>
</div>

You are now <<print Math.floor($character.age)>> summers old, growing up within the protection of your tribe. Each day brings new experiences and lessons as you learn the ways of your people.

Your family watches over you, teaching you the skills you will need to survive and contribute to the tribe. The other children have become your friends and rivals, sharing in games that prepare you for adult responsibilities.

What would you like to do today?

<<link "Help with chores around camp">>
  <<goto "ChildhoodChores">>
<</link>>

<<link "Play with the other children">>
  <<goto "ChildhoodPlay">>
<</link>>

<<link "Learn from the tribal elders">>
  <<goto "ChildhoodLearning">>
<</link>>